    "body": "CI resource admission considered only the newest 100 MR pipelines, so older jobs still occupying resources disappeared from its queue count. Request all pipeline pages while retaining the page size and ordering.\n\nValidation: actual ci_is_busy test supplies 100 newer pipelines and busy older pipelines on a subsequent page; baseline admits the job and fixed source waits. CPU-only API fixture; Ruff, Black and isort pass.\n\nReview requested: @NVIDIA/mcore-oncall. This PR is ready for review with CPU regression evidence above. Upstream runner validation remains subject to NVIDIA contributor vetting.\n",
